E AX3052 376-restrict-unknown-name.ax:18:6-13 restriction-unknown "`slipped` claims `restrict(no-fo)`, and `no-fo` names no restriction" ?"the restrictions this compiler checks are `no-cast`, `no-cast:deep`, `no-io`, `no-alloc`, `no-foreign` and `no-recursion`, comma-separated inside one `restrict(...)`. The list is closed, so a name outside it is not metadata - it is a claim in the one place the compiler has said it checks, and it would otherwise read like a guarantee and buy silence"
